## STATUS TRACKING

Throughout the workflow, maintain status using these markers:
- `[to-do]`: Step not yet started
- `[in-progress]`: Step currently being worked on
- `[done]`: Step completed
- `[blocked]`: Step cannot proceed (requires attention)

## SCRIPT REFERENCE

Key scripts used in the workflow:
- **Context Verification**: `rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh`
- **Context Synchronization**: `rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh "{FeatureName}" "{SubFeatureName}" "{Status}"`
- **Test Path Verification**: `rules/tdd/scripts/verify-test-path.sh "{FeatureName}"`
- **Run Tests**: `server/tdd/scripts/run-test.sh -t '{TestName}'` or `--file={FeatureName}.test.ts`
- **Performance Testing**: `server/tdd/scripts/performance-test.sh --feature={FeatureName}`
- **Workflow Reset**: `rules/tdd/scripts/reset-workflow-state.sh`
